    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the only warden of this prison! But there are five cells, and the prisoners are constantly trying to escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The red circle represents your gaze. Move it with the arrow keys to warn prisoners and prevent their escape.<br>As time passes, the prisoners' escape gauge fills up. If you lose focus, the prison may be empty before you know it.<br>A time management surveillance game that tests your quick thinking and reflexes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How many prisoners can you keep under watch?</strong></p>",
